  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Returns a list of all currently available keys of this Key-Value Storage. The list of keys is only accurate if no key-value pair is added or deleted at the same time. This method uses transaction semantics, it sees the current state of transaction, not the actual physical storage.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
